# noBS CAD — always-on agent rules

- Local-first: no cloud backends or account systems.
- Geometry truth is Rust + OCCT (`crates/*`, `mcp-server`). UI/Three/Bevy are views.
- Prefer MCP reproduction for modeling bugs; keep one stateful MCP process per part.
- Preserve stable edge/face/sketch IDs across history ops.
- Issue-first: search/dedupe issues; branch `issue/<n>-slug` in a worktree; babysit PRs to merge.
- New engine/export/MCP code: Rust. Do not reimplement B-rep in TypeScript.
- Do not weaken CI or force-push `main` to land changes.
